---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Privacy';
const description = 'Apostille Atlas privacy policy: no accounts or advertising trackers, an optional request form and an optional email signup.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Apostille Atlas is a static website. We don't run accounts, comments, advertising, or third-party tracking scripts, and we don't set cookies. There are two optional forms, the apostille request form and the email signup, both described below.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub processes technical request data (such as IP address) to deliver pages and keep the service secure. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <h2>The apostille request form</h2>
  <p>If you use the <a href="/get-it-done/">"Get it done for me" form</a>, we collect what you type: the document type, issuing state, destination country, deadline, number of documents, your name, your email, and any notes. The form is delivered to our inbox by <a href="https://formsubmit.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FormSubmit</a>, a form-to-email service, which processes the submission to deliver it.</p>
  <p>We use these details only to pass your request to one or more independent apostille services so they can reply to you with a quote, and to answer you ourselves. We don't sell them, add you to a mailing list, or use them for advertising. Once a service has your request, its own privacy policy applies. To have your request deleted, email us at the address below.</p>
  <h2>Email updates</h2>
  <p>Some pages have an optional form to get our checklist and occasional update emails. If you sign up, your email address is sent to Brevo (Sendinblue SAS), the service that stores our list and sends the emails, under <a href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brevo's privacy policy</a>. We ask you to confirm by email before anything is sent, we use your address only for these emails, and we don't sell or share it. Every email has a one-click unsubscribe link, and you can ask us to delete your address at any time using the contact below. This is separate from the request form: sending a request doesn't add you to this list.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>If we add privacy-friendly, cookieless page-view counting, we'll name the tool here before it goes live.</p>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to official government pages and to notary service providers. Those sites have their own privacy policies. If links to a provider are affiliate links, that provider may know you arrived from this site. See the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com">ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com</a>.</p>
  <p class="meta">Effective November 22, 2026. Updated November 23, 2026 to describe the request form.</p>
</Base>
